# No technical text on the storefront

`apps/storefront` and any store API payload the shop page renders are for the buyer. Russian, short, human.

Never show HTTP statuses, JSON, stack traces, English exception text, field names, URLs, token/OAuth/Medusa/Ozon API codes, or admin instructions ("подключите кабинет", "API", "настройках магазина").

Sanitize at the boundary: map backend errors to a generic line before they reach the template (`Не удалось загрузить пункты выдачи.`, `Не удалось посчитать доставку.`). If unsure, use the fallback. Logs and admin UI may stay specific.
